  "goodToKnow": "Die Opferrolle is the victim role: sich in der Opferrolle gefallen (to enjoy playing the victim), aus der Opferrolle herauskommen. It's often used critically of people or politicians who present themselves as victims. Das Opfer means victim and sacrifice; Opfer is also a crude schoolyard insult. Die Rolle is a role. Plural: die Opferrollen."
